<#ftl output_format="HTML">
<!doctype html><html><body style="margin:0;background:#f4f7f6;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#172b26"><div style="max-width:560px;margin:24px auto;background:white;padding:32px;border-radius:12px"><h1 style="color:#198754">ArenaOps</h1><h2>Your academy account is ready to set up</h2><p>Hello ${user.firstName!user.username},</p><p>You have been registered with <strong>${user.attributes.arenaAcademyName!"your academy"}</strong>.</p><p>Your username: <strong>${user.username}</strong></p><p>Verify your email and create your password securely in Keycloak.</p><p><a href="${link}" style="display:inline-block;background:#198754;color:white;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:6px">Set up account</a></p><p>This link expires in ${linkExpiration} minutes. If it expires, ask your academy owner to resend the account setup email.</p><p>Never share your password. If you did not expect this invitation, contact your academy owner.</p><p style="color:#526277">ArenaOps · Logos Technologies</p></div></body></html>
